{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/130885-what-do-you-want-from-the-bonus-solar-charms-book","id":130885,"title":"What do you want from the Bonus Solar Charms book?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-10T16:22:29-07:00","id":130885,"title":"What do you want from the Bonus Solar Charms book?","content":"So, the KS had a reward tier where you could pay to work with the authors and Devs (but they'll probably offload that responsibility to Vance) to create an official custom Solar Charm for inclusion in a pdf mini-supplement. I was one of those who pledged for this, but I know there were a bunch of other people who did too.<br /> <br /> Since the surveys are going now now, I'm curious. What's everyone planning on getting for their charm? I have to admit, I think I need to see the existing charms and rules before I can decide what I actually want, but I'm probably going to go for a Twilight charm. Maybe something akin to the spell charms, like Wyld Shaping, Chirality Prohibition Index, or the Shinmaic Charms.<br /> <br /> Or, once the core drops, maybe I'll be able to see a nice opening for some synergy with the existing charms. Or maybe I'll do an Economics charm, in honor of an old character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T16:42:04-07:00","id":130964,"title":"","content":"You know how King Arthur wasn't the best swordsman in Camelot, or the most pious knight, or the most virtuous knight, but he was the best king, and the Knights of the Round Table were willing to follow him even though he was weaker than they were? That's the idea I'm playing with; something that elevates the Solar's vassals beyond his abilities, yet also grants upon the Solar the title of King.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking Socialize or Bureaucracy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T16:58:14-07:00","id":130986,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/130885-what-do-you-want-from-the-bonus-solar-charms-book#post130885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(but they'll probably offload that responsibility to Vance)</div> </div> </div> </div>That you guys should be so lucky! No, they're probably going to offload the responsibility onto me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T17:18:30-07:00","id":131027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also pledged for that tier. After discarding more ideas than I can keep track of, I've decided there's no value for me brainstorming further until I have the EX3 Solar Charms to look at, and see what I want to do that they don't allow for.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this is my approach as well. I want to see what trees satisfy me as-is and what ones look like they might need an additional thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Won't you believe in him? Even if there is no God, or Buddha...there is still Kamen Rider.&quot; \u2014Taki Kazuya, <i>Kamen Rider SPIRITS</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">Now...count up </span><span style=\"color:#4B0082\">all your sins.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/160-cyclonejoker","name":"CycloneJoker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T18:48:38-07:00","id":131165,"title":"","content":"Once the book drops, we all might want to discuss it together a bit, just so we don't all end up asking for the same thing and force Eric to have to recontact everyone involved..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T18:56:08-07:00","id":131170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/130885-what-do-you-want-from-the-bonus-solar-charms-book?p=131165#post131165\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once the book drops, we all might want to discuss it together a bit, just so we don't all end up asking for the same thing and force Eric to have to recontact everyone involved..</div> </div> </div> </div>You know I was kidding, right?<br /> <br /> I mean, I <i>might</i> end up doing some or all the backer Charms, but it's not especially likely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T19:20:47-07:00","id":131199,"title":"","content":"Cooking Charms!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/457-arcanus-dicere","name":"Arcanus Dicere","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T07:11:59-07:00","id":132156,"title":"","content":"I'm also one of the charm backers, and have a short list of 3-4 potential charm areas I'd be interested in seeing. I'm thinking of both discussing with other backers (such as right now) to make sure we paint a good broad spectrum, and also giving 2-3 ideas to the writers so that they can find the one that is the most appropriate, Solar, and awesome, rather than shoehorning something into the splat that ends up being lackluster. Current ideas include<br /> - a bureaucracy charm explicitly for making investments/cash in some fashion,<br /> - a permanent-style Solar charm that lets you benefit from actually being in the sun (e.g. Apollo, Superman, etc),<br /> - a craft/lore charm that lets you go 'inside your head' to do calculations and design work without needing pen, paper etc, <br /> - a charm that lets you do non-lethal damage to a target/patient. Even if you have to do open-heart surgery, or use your super daiklave in an attack, the flesh will heal back together afterwards so that they're guaranteed not to die. They may be (and should be) unconscious for hours, but there's no risk of death.<br /> <br /> Just some ideas I've got right now, and when the time comes, I'm sure we'll chat again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/217-greenlantern","name":"GreenLantern","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar217_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T08:58:33-07:00","id":132320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreenLantern</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/130885-what-do-you-want-from-the-bonus-solar-charms-book?p=132156#post132156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- a craft/lore charm that lets you go 'inside your head' to do calculations and design work without needing pen, paper etc,.</div> </div> </div> </div>+1 on this.<br /> <br /> Also, I've always wanted to see charms that expand your anima into an AoE time-of-day (Night castes make night fall, Dawns make dawn, etc.) at least cosmetically for dramatic effect<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T10:22:56-07:00","id":132373,"title":"","content":"Most of the charms on Tiresias homebrew solar charms page are brilliant if not all of them. I would love to see them<br /> become canon charms in a book but if they do not i am sure he or i can come up with mechanics and use them in<br /> our games regardless with player/storyteller permission.<br /> <br /> Here is the link to his thread <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms/page4\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...r-charms/page4</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you think nobody cares if you're alive, try missing a couple of payments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2890-walker-of-ebony-clouds","name":"Walker-of-Ebony-Clouds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T16:34:36-07:00","id":132866,"title":"","content":"It will be interesting to see how much of the stuff people are brainstorming here is actually in the corebook, given how many charms there are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T21:25:51-07:00","id":133160,"title":"","content":"Recently I rewrote some 2E martial arts to do this, so I dunno if it should be a solar charm or what, but:<br /> <br /> A legendary swordsman with a babe under one arm, the other hand on the hilt of his blade. A hundred soldiers sworn to kill the newborn heir to the throne so their master's claim will be unchallenged.<br /> <br /> The sword is sheathed; the soldiers lie dead, the swordsman bleeds from a dozen cuts.<br /> <br /> The young Prince is completely unharmed.<br /> <br /> (Give me a charm that helps do that.<br /> <br /> See also: &quot;Batman, don't you have <i>any</i> idea how to hold a baby?&quot;<br /> <a href=\"http://scans-daily.dreamwidth.org/2270124.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://scans-daily.dreamwidth.org/2270124.html</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","user":"Guancyto","date":". 05-12-2014, 12:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-11T22:38:09-07:00","id":133204,"title":"","content":"Interesting stealth charms.<br /> <br /> Many, many games make sneaking a delay, a put off until you reach the fight. Give me options that make sneaking legitimately exciting, rewarding and challenging.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}